  "prompt_mode": "chat_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nYour entire life, you've been told you're deathly allergic to bees. You've always had people protecting you from them, be it your mother or a hired hand. Today, one slips through and lands on your shoulder. You hear a tiny voice say \"Your Majesty, what are your orders?\" I see the bee and without thinking, squash it with a shoe. The next day the same thing happened, I squashed it with a shoe but this time stopped to really think about what was happening and were these bees trying to communicate with me. The next day I got dressed in a Tyvek suit, sat by my window and waited. Sure enough, another bee flies in, lands on my shoulder and asks what my orders are. I simply cant believe my senses. I ask the bee why they have come to ask for my help. They said I am the only one who can save the bee population from disappearing. I ask them what can I, a young boy do to help every bee in the world.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 30,
  "reference_text": " The bee says \"We need your help to stop the human race from destroying every flower and plant on earth. They continued to tell me that I am actually a prince bee that has been kidnapped by an evil corporation, bent on destroying the worlds flowers so they can sell their artificial ones and make huge profits.",
